    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Create a Conditional Flowchart\r\n\r\nExplore the flowchart components. Then, create your own flowchart to model the following conditional:\r\n\r\n**Mute Toggle**\r\n- If the user toggles the sound to ON, set the volume to 50 and show the active speaker icon.\r\n- If the user toggles the sound to OFF, set the volume to 0 and show the slashed speaker icon.\r\n\r\nSave your sketch to your **Backpack**, so you can use it in the following level.",
